(key: "swarm-that-walks/swarm-feast", blueprint: "2bc89f53d0b28754b994e6521f34832c", name: "Swarm Feast", summary: "Enemies within 50 ft take 4d6 (+1d6 per swarm size) a round and are devoured if they die; ranged attacks on you miss 50%; ends Form and Infest.", guide: "other-mythic-paths#swarm-feast")
